{"schema":1,"revision":82151298,"page":{"pageid":8550093,"title":"欧洲内战","displayTitle":"歐洲內戰","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>歐洲內戰</b>是一個概念，旨在將<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2\" title=\"歐洲\">歐洲</a>一系列19世紀和20世紀的衝突描述為假定的歐洲社會中的總體內戰的一部分。與這場歐洲內戰相關的時間範圍因歷史學家而異。一些描述的範圍是1914年至1945年，因此包括<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%98\" title=\"第一次世界大戰\">第一次世界大戰</a>，<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E5%A4%A7%E6%88%98\" title=\"第二次世界大戰\">第二次世界大戰</a>以及兩次世界大戰之間的許多戰爭<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。也有人認為這一時期始於1870年的<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%99%AE%E6%B3%95%E6%88%98%E4%BA%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"普法戰爭\">普法戰爭</a>或1905年。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"参考文献\"><span id=\".E5.8F.82.E8.80.83.E6.96.87.E7.8C.AE\"></span>參考文獻</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2%E5%86%85%E6%88%98&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：參考文獻\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://m.spiegel.de/international/world/a-946052.html#spRedirectedFrom=www&amp;referrrer=https://www.google.it/\">\"World War I Led to a Century of Violence in the Middle East\"</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20171206123304/http://m.spiegel.de/international/world/a-946052.html#spRedirectedFrom=www&amp;referrrer=https://www.google.it/\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）. \"The so-called European Civil War, a term used to describe the period of bloody violence that racked Europe from 1914 onwards, came to an end in 1945\".</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.codfw.main‐dc9d595b8‐54gxr\nCached time: 20261028123158\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 59/1000000\nRevision size: 1014/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 464/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 121/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 6/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1804/5000000 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   19.230      1 Template:Reflist\n100.00%   19.230      1 -total\n  6.92%    1.331      1 Template:Wayback\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID 911d3809-d2cb-11f1-8f29-fb41ef9fe6f5 -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key zhwiki:pcache:8550093:|#|:idhash:canonical!zh-tw and timestamp 20261028123158 and revision id 